        "name": "The Relentless Storm",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Volibear's Attacks and abilities grant Attack Speed, and eventually cause his Attacks to deal bonus magic damage to nearby enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Volibear gains <span>(5% + (0.03% Ability Power)) Attack Speed</span> for 6 seconds whenever he deals damage with an Ability or Attack, stacking up to 5 times.<br /><br />At 5 stacks, Volibear's claws ignite with lightning, causing his Attacks to deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(11 + (45% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to the target and 4 closest enemies.",
