        "name": "Thundering Smash",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Volibear gains speed towards enemies, <status>Stunning</status> and damaging the first one he Attacks.",
        "bodyHtml": "Volibear gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">12/15.5/19/22.5/26% Move Speed</span>, doubled to <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">24/31/38/45/52%</span> towards enemy champions for the next 4 seconds. While active, Volibear's next Attack deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(10/20/30/40/50 + (100% Attack Damage) + (160% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stuns</span> the target for 1 second.<br /><br />Volibear becomes enraged if an enemy <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Immobilizes</span> him before he <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stuns</span> a target, ending the Ability early but refreshing its Cooldown.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Volibear gains 25 attack range for this attack.</span>",
