        "name": "Frenzied Maul",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Volibear damages an enemy, applying on-hit effects and marking them.  Casting this ability again on the same target deals bonus damage and Heals Volibear.",
        "bodyHtml": "Volibear mauls an enemy, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(5/30/55/80/105 + (110% Attack Damage) + (6% bonus Health)) physical damage</span> and marking them for 8 seconds.<br /><br />If this Ability is used on a marked target, its damage is increased to <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(5/30/55/80/105 + (110% Attack Damage) + (6% bonus Health))</span> and Volibear restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">20/35/50/65/80 plus 8/11/14/17/20% missing Health</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Empowered damage scales with (Damage multiplier: 150% + 25%)<br />This Ability applies on-hit effects.<br />Healing is 50% effective against minions.</span><br />",
