        "bodyHtml": "Volibear summons a thundercloud that fires a lightning bolt, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/110/140/170/200 + (70% Ability Power)) plus 11/12/13/14/15% max Health magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> by 40% for 2 seconds.<br /><br />If Volibear is inside the blast zone, he gains a <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(75% Ability Power) plus 14% max Health Shield</span> for 3 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Damage against non-champions is capped at <span>(150/265/380/495/610 + (70% Ability Power))</span>.</span>",
